  "summary_en": "The UAE's June 2024 charter sets high-level principles for AI development and use: human-machine harmony, safety, anti-bias, privacy, transparency, human oversight, innovation, and peaceful coexistence. It supports the UAE AI Strategy and requires compliance with existing laws and treaties. It is voluntary, general AI guidance with no robotics-specific content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Aims to ensure ethical and responsible AI use, privacy and data security, transparency and accountability.",
   "AI systems should meet the highest safety standards; risky systems should be modified or removed.",
   "Addresses algorithmic bias and equitable access for all groups.",
   "Affirms irreplaceable human judgment and human oversight of AI to correct errors and biases.",
   "Requires compliance with international treaties and UAE laws on AI."
